CREATED:20160529T004910Z
DESCRIPTION:"Follies"\, Portland's new physical comedy showcase\, is coming
  to the Funhouse Lounge (2432 SE & 11th Ave.) beginning the first Sunday of
  October. Created and hosted by Italian performer Stefano iaboni\, whose ow
 n influences include Andy Kaufman and Monty Python\, Follies says "ciao" to
  traditional stand-up and improv and instead highlights the richly diverse\
 , artistic and hilarious world of physical comedy\, variety and sketch come
 dy.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160908T020955Z
