BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20160917T065900Z
DTEND:20160917T090000Z
DTSTAMP:20260917T012857Z
UID:4g3qnfgd49tmb01sc6l0fv6jhk@google.com
CREATED:20160612T193311Z
DESCRIPTION:Comedy bad boy Sammy Arechar (RIOT LA\, High Plains\, Bridgetow
 n) will be in town from Chicago to headline the premiere installment of Vil
 lains Comedy Cabaret at the Funhouse Lounge.  Villains is a devilishly ente
 rtaining cabaret elixir of three-parts comedy and two-parts drag and burles
 que that comes to a boil once every full moon at the Funhouse Lounge.  Join
 ing Sammy will be local neer-do-wells Caitlin Weierhauser and Dan Weber alo
 ng with a naughty burlesque performance by Jaxin Yoff (Oregon Burlesque Fes
 tival) and your hosts for this madcap\, full moon spectacle are none other 
 than Blanche (Honey Bea Hart) and Sophia (Randy Tutone) from the Funhouse L
 ounge's smash success Golden Girls Live!   \n\nVillains Comedy Cabaret harn
 esses the gravity of the moon to pull in headlining comedians from distant 
 lands and surround them with iconoclast northwest jokesters\, drag queens\,
  and burlesque performers for an evening of laughter\, lust\, and libations
 .  \n\nAfter burning up Bridgetown\, High Plains\, RIOT LA\, and the Comedy
  Exposition of Chicago\, Sammy Arechar returns to Rip City with a stage pre
 sence that is often described as "personified chicken salad" and has landed
  him gigs opening for nationally touring comedians such as T.J. Miller\, Ma
 tt Braunger\, Garfunkel and Oates\, Moshe Kasher and Kurt Braunohler. \n\nA
 lso joining in the full moon revelry will be comedian Caitlin Weierhauser (
 Lez Stand Up\, Bumbershoot) and godless wonderboy Dan Weber (Reading the Bi
 ble With Dan\, Who's Metal AF?). \n\nIn true cabaret fashion\, the evening'
 s humorists will be interspersed with wicked sexy drag and burlesque perfor
 mances by Honey Bea Hart and Jaxin Yoff.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160812T032350Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:TENTATIVE
SUMMARY:Villains Comedy Cabaret with Sammy Arechar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
