BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20160731T020000Z
DTEND:20160731T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260917T012857Z
UID:a37m85fp832jjopguuj01i8chk@google.com
CREATED:20160726T010432Z
DESCRIPTION:\nBae is gonna be servin' up summer time heat and this time it'
 s a night of Taking a stand\, Coming together and Giving back! In the front
  it's a our cool new patio\, a stage and all the fixin's... Comics\, Spoken
  word artist and musicians will take to the stage outside to make your seam
 s split and your guts bust. Our Favorite DJ Reg Master Jay will be spinning
  allate into the night!! Featuring an all POC cast\, this month will featur
 e talent from Seattle\, San Fransisco and PDX! This event is a BENEFIT! Pro
 ceeds from this show are going to the GoFundMe Educational fund for the fam
 ilies of Alton Sterling and Philando Castile as well as Black Lives Matter 
 Portland! Join us in celebration\, healing\, food\, art and danceryyyy! Tic
 kets include food and general admission. VIP options are available Drink Sp
 ecials\, Raffle Prizes and Door Prizes!
LAST-MODIFIED:20160726T010444Z
LOCATION:Funhouse Lounge
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bae Cliche's Back Yard BBQ Benefit
TRANSP:OPAQUE
